    "chunk_text": "\uf0b7 Improving night patrols, emergency\n\nvehicle inspections and checkpoint operations.\n\n\uf0b7 Special search operations targeting\n\nsuspects, criminal networks and their connections.\n\n\uf0b7 \uf041n emergency motorcycle squad\n\nYear Number of\n\ndeceased\n\npersons\n\nNumber of injured persons\n\n2020 20 16\n\n2021 22 19\n\n2022 68 53\n\n2023 56 73 2024 64 50\n\n2025 65 68\n\n1015 1016\n\n\u0db4\u0dcf\u0dbb\u0dd2\u0d9c\u0db8\u0dca\u0db1\u0dca\u0dad\u0dd4\u0dc0\n\nLegal actions were taken to identify road maps, hiding places and hidden weapon storages of criminals. Joint operations among divisional police stations, special units and intelligence units are carried out.\n\n3. Raid and recovery of illegal firearms\n\n\uf0b7 Operations to search suspicious\n\nplaces, houses, vehicles and weapon storages.\n\n\uf0b7 Recovery of illegal firearms, bullets\n\nand relevant instruments.\n\n\uf0b7 Taking legal action after identifying\n\nweapons supply and distribution networks.\n\nThis is aimed at reducing illegal weapons sharing by criminals and distribution in the country.\n\n4. Collecting intelligence data\n\nInstructions are given constantly through weekly virtual discussions with all the officers in charge of divisions, officers in charge of districts, officers in charge in order to review progress and combat organized crime.\n\n\uf0b7 Collection of information related to\n\ncriminals through crime intelligence units.\n\n\uf0b7 Inspection of activities of organized\n\ncriminal groups.\n\n\uf0b7 Analysis of connections of criminal\n\nassociation networks.\n\nAbility to identify plans of shootings earlier through intelligence data based operations.\n\n5. Obtaining public support\n\n\uf0b7 Initiating special programmes and\n\ntelephone services to obtain public information.\n\n\uf0b7 Strengthening Community Police\n\nservice.\n\n\uf0b7 Ensuring the confidentiality of\n\nindividuals who provide information and awarding financial gifts.\n\nAbility to identify suspects and criminal plans through public support.\n\n6. Taking special measures against\n\norganized crime operatives\n\n\uf0b7 Establishment of regional special\n\ncrime investigation bureaus.\n\n\uf0b7 Establishment of the Central Crime\n\nInvestigation Bureau on 04.09.2025."
