    "chunk_size_bytes": 2002,
    "chunk_text": "The Sri Lanka Police has currently initiated a system to curb and combat shootings and underworld activities in Sri Lanka.\n\n1017 1018\n\n[\u0dd9\u0dbb\u0dd4 \u0d86\u0db1\u0db1\u0dca\u0daf \u0dc0\u0dd2\u0d9c\u0da2\u0dca\u0db4\u0dcf\u0dbd \u0db8\u0dc4 \u0dcf]\n\n2026 \u0d9c\u0db4\u0db6\u0dbb\u0dc0\u0dcf\u0dbb\u0dd2 18\n\n(b) (i) The Bandaragama Police Station was established on 01.01.1948, taken over by the Sri Lanka Police on 30.01.1959 and renovations were made.\n\n(ii) Yes.\n\nRelevant preliminary activities have now been carried out to construct a new complete building, instead of the prevailing building in the police station.\n\n(iii) The Central Engineering Consultancy Bureau - CECB - was appointed as the consulting agency of this project and approval was granted for architectural plans submitted by the institution.\n\n(iv) The consulting agency was informed to prepare new estimates as per those plans and the cost estimate has not yet been finalized.\n\n(v) Yes.\n\n\uf0b7 Necessary plans were prepared for a\n\ncomplete police complex including administration building, barracks and married officers\u2019 quarters for the Bandaragama Police Station. Basic activities for the construction of this police station had been completed in 2021 and as per the Cabinet Decision on Public Expenditure review dated 02.09.2022, it was instructed to temporarily suspend the new constructions which were not started. Also, as per 03(i) of National Budget Circular No. 03/2022 dated 26.04.2022, it was informed to temporarily suspend \u201call the projects to be initiated and procurement activities for purchase of goods or work for implementation of project\u201d and as per National Budget Circular No. 04/2023 dated 26.04.2022, constructions have been limited and it was unable to initiate these constructions.\n\n\uf0b7 An Action Plan was prepared to initiate,\n\naccording to priority, the new construction projects suspended temporarily as above. This project is also included in it and it is due to finalize construction within the 2026-2028 medium-term time frame.\n\n(vi) Not applicable.\n\n(c) Does not arise."
  },
