    "chunk_text": "\u2022 Kakkachiveddai Village: The balance\n\n3.50 km pipeline has to be laid to cover the uncovered areas of that village, where only 55 families lilve. The pipe laying is proposed under CEDE Project in 2026.\n\nthe area is covered.\n\n\u2022 Thikkodai - Dumbalai: Without upgrading the upstream system by steps such as pumping and the transmission main, pipeline extension is not feasible. Design works are being carried out for improvement.\n\n\u2022 Kirankulam - Dharmapuram: It is\n\nproposed to extend the pipeline under CEDE Project in 2026. Accordingly, bids for supply of pipes are under evaluation and the laying contract document is under preparation. It is expected to complete the above work and supply water to above area by the end of this year."
